# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# The coverage run's raw output. Only the two published reports below are committed:
# `coverage/coverage-summary.json` and `coverage/lcov.info` are the machine-readable
# levels CI enforces, written by scripts/coverage-report.mjs, and are what makes the
# measured coverage readable from the default branch.
coverage/*
!coverage/coverage-summary.json
!coverage/lcov.info

